  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, whenever the ethermagus hits and deals damage with his void blade, he may spend 3 EP as an immediate action to subject the creature struck to the horrible pressures used to create that void blade in the first place. The target is entangled for 1 round with a DC 10 + 1/2 the ethermagus’s level + his Charisma modifier Fortitude save to negate.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagus#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
